contract ChannelEvents.
message ChannelNotice.
message ChannelUpdate.
field ChannelValue.
contract DataRecord.
field DataValue.
capability Delivery.
unit Desktop.
functionality Display.
scenario Example.
usecase Export.
actor Guest.
channel IdleBus.
usecase Isolated.
container Local.
dataset MemoryData.
feature Navigation.
mode Offline.
mode Online.
encoding PacketBig.
variant PacketBody.
field PacketFlag.
encoding PacketLittle.
field PacketNumber.
field PacketPayload.
database PersistentStore.
mode Quiet.
